  "review": [
    "Settled taranim/147 rendering reused with the main's own reading: the main prints قلبي (my heart) where the twin prints نفسي, so 1:1 and the title use לִבִּי יִרְעַב instead of נַפְשִׁי תִּרְעָב. No chorus field in the Arabic, so no C: line — the refrain مَن فدى نفسي مخلصي يسوع is the last line of every stanza. פדי→פָּדָה, מخلص→מוֹשִׁיעַ, חטية/עוון→חַטָּאת/מוּם, נعمة→נֹעַם, אוֹצָר (ذُخْر) per settled twin and glossary."
